<title>GERMANY: Deutsche Post loss after transfers falls in 1995.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Post loss after transfers falls in 1995.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1995 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net loss after tax, transfers  1,160   vs 2,920</p>
<p>    Group transfer to government	   1,500   vs 2,300</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities    363.62  vs 256.76</p>
<p>    Group sales				  28,570  vs 28,370</p>
<p>    Group personnel expenditure	    20,460  vs 20,570</p>
<p>    Group workforce			    307,400 vs n/a</p>
<p>Note - Full name of German post office is Deutsche Post AG. The company said sales and profit figures given earlier on its Internet page were preliminary. -- Ashley Seager, Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
